    {
      "target": "이 옷은 땀을 잘 흡수하는 특성이 있어요.",
      "reading": "I oseun ttameul jal heupsuhaneun teukseongi isseoyo.",
      "translations": {
        "en": "This shirt has the characteristic of absorbing sweat well.",
